  "queries": [
    {
      "query": "What was the progression of the Entity's assimilation into The Edge Station's architecture and its ability to metabolize or optimize containment attempts?",
      "startChapter": 10,
      "endChapter": 16
    },
    {
      "query": "How were previous thermal runaway events in Sector Two managed, and what was the nature of the structural integrity challenges faced there before this current coolant breach?",
      "startChapter": 15,
      "endChapter": 17
    }
  ]
}
```

